    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Pierre, veuf et retrait\u00e9, ne sort plus de chez lui depuis deux ans. Il d\u00e9couvre les joies d'internet gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 Alex, un jeune homme embauch\u00e9 par sa fille pour lui enseigner les rudiments de l'informatique. Sur un site de rencontre, une ravissante jeune femme, flora63, s\u00e9duite par le romantisme de Pierre, lui propose un premier rendez-vous. Amoureux, Pierre revit. Mais sur son profil il a mis une photo d\u2019Alex et non la sienne. Pierre doit alors convaincre le jeune homme de rencontrer Flora \u00e0 sa place.",
        "english": "Pierre, a retired widower, hasn't left his house in two years. He discovers the joys of the Internet thanks to Alex, a young man hired by Pierre's daughter to teach him computer basics. On a dating site, a gorgeous young woman, flora63, seduced by Pierre's romanticism, suggests they meet. Pierre, in love, starts living again. But his profile sports a photo of Alex and not of him. Pierre must convince Alex to meet Flora in his stead."
